# Static resources

Note that `old-tokeniser-disamb-gt-desc.pmhfst` is from an old build that
resulted in a smaller and faster tokenizer. The latest builds are much
larger and slower, which needs to be debugged eventually.


## Translations

openrussian.org translations are taken from https://app.togetherdb.com/db/fwoedz5fvtwvq03v/russian3/words and https://app.togetherdb.com/db/fwoedz5fvtwvq03v/russian3/translations.
